    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Olivier vient de perdre son p\u00e8re quand il d\u00e9barque \u00e0 Cuba pour son travail. Au moment de repartir, il d\u00e9cide de rester clandestinement \u00e0 la Havane, cette ville dont son p\u00e8re lui a si souvent parl\u00e9. Tr\u00e8s vite, il d\u00e9couvre une mani\u00e8re de vivre qui lui pla\u00eet, dans ce pays en pleine transition \u00e9conomique, o\u00f9 tout est interdit, o\u00f9 la d\u00e9brouille est reine. Alors qu\u2019il se fait \u00e0 sa nouvelle vie, Olivier d\u00e9couvre l\u2019existence d\u2019un surprenant mythe familiale, une histoire de pirate et de tr\u00e9sor perdu\u2026",
        "english": "Olivier's father has just died when Olivier arrives in Cuba for work. When it is time to leave, he decides to remain without a permit in Havana, this city his father often talked about. He quickly discovers a way of life that he likes, in this country undergoing major economic transition, where everything is forbidden, where resourcefulness is king. While he gets used to his new life, Olivier discovers the existence of a surprising family myth, a story of a pirate and lost treasure."
